    "design_principles": [
      "Deterministic rule resolution with explicit priority",
      "Compound requests are rules, not bypasses",
      "Negation/question/quote detection BEFORE signal matching",
      "Configuration-driven: JSON controls behavior, Python executes",
      "No hard-coded business logic in Python",
      "Every rule has explicit priority and conditions",
      "Forbidden rules are conditional with unless_any",
      "Signal deduplication prevents double-counting"
